      "name": "Innate Spellcasting",
      "type": "feat",
      "img": "icons/svg/item-bag.svg",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<p>The inquisitor's innate spellcasting ability is Intelligence (spell save DC 17, +9 to spell attacks). It can innately cast the following spells, requiring no components: At will: <em>ray of enfeeblement</em>, <em>phantasmal force</em>, 3/day: <em>crown of madness,</em> <em>fear</em>, <em>mind spike</em> 1/day: <em>eyebite</em>, <em>hallucinatory terrain</em></p>",
